tools: fixed-point kinds and per-language link sizes (Mudb0y 7760e07)

Ports the tool half of thousandths support: globals.py learns the
F/fixed kind (cells, emit, text, read, where) and sets.py learns
per-language link sizes (LINK table from lift61 link_new, emit,
model_from_c, text read/write). Needed to lift languages with
doubles; inert for checked-in trees until re-lifted.

